WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.418
♪♪

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:02.169
Ian:
Gandi.

00:00:02.169 --> 00:00:03.337
Ian:
Eleanor Roosevelt.

00:00:03.337 --> 00:00:04.504
Nelson Mandela.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:07.591
Henry Ford...these are leaders
who trusted their inner voice.

00:00:09.301 --> 00:00:11.261
Oh you’ve got to be kidding me.

00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:13.347
♪♪

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:15.933
Mythic Quest is way better off
without them.

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:16.516
Damn straight.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.726
This is our masterpiece.

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:18.393
(Clapping)

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:19.686
We did it! We really did it!

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:20.312
Yes!

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:21.146
♪♪

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:21.980
David:
MQ’s doing well.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.732
I know you guys didn’t think I
could do it.

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:26.902
No no, we, I mean we literally
haven’t said your name in a
year.

00:00:26.902 --> 00:00:27.361
Oh.

00:00:27.361 --> 00:00:27.986
♪♪

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:30.572
Carol:
I’d like to introduce you to our
newest employee.

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:31.365
I’m glad you’re back.

00:00:31.365 --> 00:00:34.117
You know as janitor I see a lot
of things, but you have nothing
to worry about.

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:36.453
Brad:
There’s nothing like strange or
nefarious going on.

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:37.621
That’s some Illuminati.

00:00:37.621 --> 00:00:39.122
And even if there was you’d
never know it.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:40.540
Um... sorry, wait, what?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:41.375
♪♪

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:44.169
He’s always wanted to bring MQ
to Hollywood, but I’m the first
one to pull it off.

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:46.004
How could I not even be
consulted on it?

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:48.131
My DNA is literally all over
that game.

00:00:48.966 --> 00:00:49.591
Gross.

00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:52.511
♪ work it out, work it out,
work, work, work it out.♪

00:00:52.511 --> 00:00:53.637
(Laughing)

00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:55.347
♪♪

00:00:55.347 --> 00:00:58.892
Joe Manganiello? No one’s gonna
believe that he can play me, he’s
not big enough!

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:00.269
David:
He’s like 6’4”.

00:01:00.269 --> 00:01:01.812
-6’5”.
-6’5”.

00:01:01.812 --> 00:01:03.146
♪♪

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:05.399
You have made a huge mistake.

00:01:05.399 --> 00:01:07.067
Ian Elizabeth Grimm!

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:10.612
I’m building an entire game from
scratch and you’re pacing around
in the Metaverse.

00:01:10.612 --> 00:01:12.781
(Crying)

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:14.950
I totally get it, I had to work
with those wackos too.

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:16.535
♪♪

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:16.952
(Laughing)

00:01:16.994 --> 00:01:17.452
(Laughing)

00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:18.036
(Laughing)

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:18.787
(Laughing)

00:01:18.829 --> 00:01:21.498
(Laughing)

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:22.749
♪♪

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:23.834
Carol:
Y’all are cray-cray.

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:24.376
Ba-nay-nay.

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:25.002
(Screaming)

00:01:25.002 --> 00:01:25.711
♪♪

00:01:25.711 --> 00:01:25.919
Yeah!

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:26.545
♪♪

00:01:26.545 --> 00:01:27.379
(Screaming)

00:01:28.422 --> 00:01:30.007
Poppy:
Post-it notes are a part of my
system.

00:01:30.007 --> 00:01:32.676
Why can’t you just be a normal
person and just take notes in
your phone?

00:01:32.676 --> 00:01:37.097
Because like a normal person I
lost my phone ages ago and now
Dana takes my calls for me.

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.057
Don't nobody call you.

00:01:39.057 --> 00:01:42.311
♪♪

